      "text": "Helpful guide to hiring your first @Grok @Bot employee. \n\nIt really is like hiring an amazing helper that learns your needs and gets smarter almost every day!",
      "quote": {
        "author": "distortgeekin",
        "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2100904075550158848/Zrqh521I_200x200.jpg",
