        "id": "2105275395901726845",
        "images": [],
        "media": [],
        "name": "distort",
        "text": "Grok Bot could be the first thing you hire instead of prompt\n\nIt can own a job, work inside your tools for hours and come back with finished work\n\nIn this article, I show you how https://x.com/i/article/2105262478535847936",
