      "text": "Grok 4.7 is #1 on the AA Cyber Index",
      "quote": {
        "author": "XFreeze",
        "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1876785200010539008/2_HFJjq9_200x200.jpg",
        "created_at_shanghai": "2026-10-04 23:48:57",
