        ],
        "media": [
          {
            "height": 2500,
            "type": "photo",
            "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HTzDY_UWMAEF8oJ.jpg?name=small",
            "width": 4000
          }
        ],
        "name": "X Freeze",
        "text": "Grok 4.7 xHigh ranked #1 on Artificial Analysis’ Cyber Index\n\nGrok 4.7 is now very powerful with serious cybersecurity capabilities\n\nIt outperformed Claude Opus 5.5, Fable 5.1, ChatGPT 6 Astra and other frontier models\n\nThe Cyber Index combines three evaluations:\n\n• CWE-Bench-AA\n• DeepsecBench-AA\n• CyberGym-E2E-AA\n\nGrok 4.7 is now sitting right at the frontier of cybersecurity reasoning",
        "url": "https://x.com/XFreeze/status/2106773576258851087",
        "verified": true,
        "verified_type": "individual"
      },
      "retweet": null,
